            "review_title": "Review at ViLi Wok",
            "review_text": "Vincent R\n35 contributions\n0\nGreat noodles!\nJul 2017 • Solo\nI live a two-minute walk from their Bach Mai location in Hanoi and it is amazing. I wish the portions were a little bigger but the noodles are delicious. I've had the sweet and sour, the teriyaki and the oyster sauce option, you can't go wrong with chicken, beef or pork, all are tremendous. And the juices are good too! The staff is very helpful too, sometimes very little English but they are very friendly and efficient. I definitely recommend this place!\nRead more\nWritten July 18, 2017",
